        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bakahazard 3 is the sequel of Bakahazard 1+2.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An RPG that turns BAD ENDING from the prequel into GOOD ENDING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the protagonist nearly escaped from death (?), he and his classmates from Breakfast High School have found themselves on another bizarre adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat, more evolved than ever! More skills to throw on enemies! More buffs to stack! Stronger allies! And... rumor has it that Earth just updated with a new 'Resistance' system—the lower your resistance, the faster your HP drops? Should've known all that pay-to-win cash was spent on buffing the enemies instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scouring a snow mountain for hot springs... Battling RGB-lit tanks in a fictional urban warzone... Taking down a bizarre cult on a remote island... Bakahazard 3 delivers an even more thrilling, hilarious, and pulse-pounding adventure than Bakahazard 1+2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enhanced turn-based RPG battle system, still old-school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richer story! Maybe even a little mind-bending? And of course, packed with witty and hilarious dialogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10 hours of tight, linear storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy but looks like a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy but looks... not that much like a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the rest of your days snuggled in your cozy little bed at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or just beat up the very same bed that's been waiting for your return.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bakahazard 3 is the sequel of Bakahazard 1+2.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An RPG that turns BAD ENDING from the prequel into GOOD ENDING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the protagonist nearly escaped from death (?), he and his classmates from Breakfast High School have found themselves on another bizarre adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat, more evolved than ever! More skills to throw on enemies! More buffs to stack! Stronger allies! And... rumor has it that Earth just updated with a new 'Resistance' system—the lower your resistance, the faster your HP drops? Should've known all that pay-to-win cash was spent on buffing the enemies instead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scouring a snow mountain for hot springs... Battling RGB-lit tanks in a fictional urban warzone... Taking down a bizarre cult on a remote island... Bakahazard 3 delivers an even more thrilling, hilarious, and pulse-pounding adventure than Bakahazard 1+2!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enhanced turn-based RPG battle system, still old-school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richer story! Maybe even a little mind-bending? And of course, packed with witty and hilarious dialogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 10 hours of tight, linear storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy but looks like a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy but looks... not that much like a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the rest of your days snuggled in your cozy little bed at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or just beat up the very same bed that's been waiting for your return.</p>",
        "short_description": "An RPG that turns BAD ENDING from the prequel into GOOD ENDING! Follow the steps of Nobi and his classmates from Breakfast High School as they find themselves on another bizarre adventure after the prequel Bakahazard Series!",
